@sheet Data [tsv]
team	tickets	hours
Blue	4	6
Red	7	8
Green	5	5

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Tickets | =SUM(Data!tickets) |
| Hours | =SUM(Data!hours) |
| Max hours | =MAX(Data!hours) |

@sheet Review
@header | Metric | Value |
| Load | =Summary!B2+Summary!B3 |
| Ceiling | =Summary!B4 |
